# Core Architecture

Dependency direction (JS/DOM):

```text
@dndgem/core <- @dndgem/dom <- framework adapters (siblings)
```

Approved adapter folders: `react`, `vue`, `angular`, `svelte`. Only create a folder in the matching DND-FX.n sprint. DND-FX.2 is COMPLETE (`packages/vue`). DND-FX.3 is COMPLETE (`packages/angular`). DND-FX.4 is COMPLETE (`packages/svelte`). Meta-framework fixtures live under `apps/compat-*`, never under `packages/`.

- `@dndgem/core` must not depend on DOM, HTMLElement, CSS, window, document, ResizeObserver, React, Vue, Angular, Svelte, dnd-kit, or AI SDKs.
- No reverse imports. Adapters must not depend on another adapter.
- No private cross-package source imports; use public package exports only.
- Do not create placeholder packages for vue/angular/svelte/flutter/ai/enterprise/cloud/next/nuxt/sveltekit/framework-core.
